        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "\"Please, kill me.\"\n\"If you get out with me, then I'll kill you.\"\n\nTheir strange \"promise\" formed a peculiar bond between the two of them.\nWhere are they? Why were they caught?\nThey desperately try to escape from the sealed building!\n\n\"Angels of Death\" is a psycho horror adventure game, which consists of four episodes.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "\"Por favor, mátame.\"\n\"Si logras salir conmigo, te mataré.\"\n\nAquella extraña \"promesa\" forjó un vínculo peculiar entre los dos.\n¿Dónde están? ¿Por qué los atraparon?\n¡Intentan desesperadamente escapar del edificio sellado!\n\n\"Angels of Death\" es un juego de aventura y terror psicológico que consta de cuatro episodios.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
